{"schemaVersion":1,"id":202,"sections":[{"id":"346003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20531],"start":0,"count":12},{"id":"346003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20532],"start":12,"count":14}],"frames":[{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:1","scriptId":20531,"text":"“这次叫你们来的目的我想都知道了吧？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:2","scriptId":20531,"text":"“是进行和旅行者战斗的演练吧，我们已经习惯了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:3","scriptId":20531,"text":"“哟哟哟，口气不小嘛～那我可就要用杀手锏了～我很担心你们被打得溃不成军啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:4","scriptId":20531,"text":"“哼哼～兰布达和埃普西隆的组合我们已经习惯了，还有其他的玩法吗。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:5","scriptId":20531,"text":"“那你就戴上头盔等着吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:6","scriptId":20531,"text":"“记得使用正常的痛感系数，这次我可不会再受伤了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":747,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:7","scriptId":20531,"text":"“长官……你这样挑衅波西娅可不好吧……万一她故意让我们输呢。”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":747,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:8","scriptId":20531,"text":"“也对，波西娅！你可要保持公平啊，我可不想面对山一样多的战车兽啊！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":747,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:9","scriptId":20531,"text":"“不用担心，对手的数量和你们这边一模一样，这总可以了吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:10","scriptId":20531,"text":"“那就开始吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:11","scriptId":20531,"text":"“哼哼～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346003-PROLOGUE:20531:12","scriptId":20531,"text":"波西娅开启了模拟战斗程式。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:1","scriptId":20532,"text":"没想到这次的敌人竟然是泰莱塔……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:2","scriptId":20532,"text":"虽然猜到波西娅可能会有意增加一些难度，但没想到突然就进入了这种地狱模式……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:3","scriptId":20532,"text":"“怎么样？满足了吧～这可是最高级的敌人了哟～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:4","scriptId":20532,"text":"“疼疼疼……波西娅你知不知道“轻重”这两个字怎么写？泰莱塔……光她一个人就够我们受的了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:5","scriptId":20532,"text":"“哦？是吗？是你说要保证公平的啊？本来只打算测试一下泰莱塔的模拟数据是不是可靠。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:6","scriptId":20532,"text":"“真是太可靠了……我算是体验到内脏被烧焦的滋味了……嘴里冒烟的感觉真是不想再体验了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:7","scriptId":20532,"text":"我看了看另外几位还在呻吟中的伙伴，我比起她们来应该是最后一个退场的，但这反而减少了我受到的痛苦。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:8","scriptId":20532,"text":"佐伊她们还没从“阵亡”中恢复过来，因为过于真实的痛觉系统，测试者受到过量的痛苦时会造成短暂的昏迷。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:9","scriptId":20532,"text":"虽然对肉体的负担不大，但是精神上会少量的损伤，所以这类测试之后会休息一段时间。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:10","scriptId":20532,"text":"当然了，调低痛觉系数就可以轻松解决这个问题，不过波西娅这次肯定没这么做。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:11","scriptId":20532,"text":"“我错了……下次再也不敢夸海口了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:12","scriptId":20532,"text":"“好吧，不过根据德尔塔的模拟数据，你们所面对的泰莱塔还没发挥全力呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:13","scriptId":20532,"text":"“您太抬举我们了，想靠一个小队就攻下泰莱塔，简直是痴人说梦吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"346003-EPILOGUE:20532:14","scriptId":20532,"text":"“哼，也对～等你的队员们恢复了之后，去芮蓓那里拿报酬吧，这次的数据我很满意～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
